          }
        },
        "text_aKbN7q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A “King of Gems” known for its brilliance, beauty, and shine! Diamond is known as the king of jewels in the world of precious stones and this mineral is renowned for its grandeur since the ancient times and therefore, is a rare gemstone to be found on the mother earth.<br/>Selecting a diamond starts by recognizing the mystic characteristics of each stone. Where sparkle is the most important factor while buying, the right buying depends on the 4Cs of Diamond. So, here’s everything you need to know about the diamonds to help you make the right buying decision.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
